ے ڈرو اور میرا حکم مانو", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "maka bertakwalah kepada Allah dan taatlah kepadaku.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "فَٱتَّقُوا۟", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/4161050f2ef1e09cdae4.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "pa se bojte (Allaha)", "en": "so be mindful (of God)", "tr": "öyleyse sakının", "fr": "craignez donc", "id": "maka bertakwalah", "ur": "تو ڈرو", "bn": "অতএব (আল্লাহকে) ভয় কর", "fa": "پس تقوا پیشه کنید"}}, {"text": "ٱللَّهَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَأَطِيعُونِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "23:87", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "antum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/2760.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "They will say: Unto Allah (all that belongeth). Say: Will ye not then keep duty (unto Him)?", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "\"(Onlar da) Allah'ındır.\" diyecekler. \"Şu halde siz Allah'tan korkmaz mısınız?\" de.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اب کہیں گے یہ اللہ ہی کی شان ہے، تم فرماؤ پھر کیوں نہیں ڈرتے", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Mereka akan menjawab: \"Kepunyaan Allah\". Katakanlah: \"Maka apakah kamu tidak bertakwa?\"", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "سَيَقُولُونَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "لِلَّهِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "قُلْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَفَلَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "تَتَّقُونَ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/fbf3e7817409277c2ee4.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "you (all) are mindful (of God)", "bs": "bojite se", "tr": "Allah'tan sakınıyorsunuz", "fr": "vous craignez (Dieu)", "id": "kalian bertakwa", "ur": "تم سب تقویٰ اختیار کرتے ہو", "bn": "তোমরা তাকওয়া অবলম্বন কর", "fa": "تقوا پیشه می‌کنید"}}]}, {"ref": "16:128", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/2029.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "Lo! Allah is with those who keep their duty unto Him and those who are doers of good.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Şüphesiz Allah, takva sahipleri ile ve iyilikte bulunanlarla beraberdir.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "بیشک اللہ ان کے ساتھ ہے جو ڈرتے ہیں اور جو نیکیاں کرتے ہیں،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Sesungguhnya Allah beserta orang-orang yang bertakwa dan orang-orang yang berbuat kebaikan.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "إِنَّ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱللَّهَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مَعَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱتَّقَوا۟", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/e727f3ed05a7170ec246.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "they were mindful (of God)", "bs": "bojali su se", "tr": "sakındılar", "fr": "ils ont craint", "id": "mereka telah bertakwa", "ur": "انہوں نے تقویٰ اختیار کیا", "bn": "তারা তাকওয়া অবলম্বন করেছিল", "fa": "تقوا پیشه کردند"}}, {"text": "وَّٱلَّذِينَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "هُم", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مُّحْسِنُونَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "10:63", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/1427.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "Those who believe and keep their duty (to Allah).", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Onlar ki, iman etmişler ve Allah'a karşı gelmekten sakınmışlardır.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "وہ جو ایمان لائے اور پرہیزگاری کرتے ہیں،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "(Yaitu) orang-orang yang beriman dan mereka selalu bertakwa.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ءَامَنُوا۟", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَكَانُوا۟", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يَتَّقُونَ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/fd23ebe2aac6ee65db77.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "boje se (Allaha)", "en": "they are mindful (of God)", "tr": "sakınırlar", "fr": "ils craignent (Dieu)", "id": "mereka bertakwa", "ur": "پرہیزگاری کرتے ہیں", "bn": "তারা তাকওয়া অবলম্বন করে", "fa": "تقوا پیشه می‌کنند"}}]}, {"ref": "24:52", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/2843.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "He who obeyeth Allah and His messenger, and feareth Allah, and keepeth duty (unto Him): such indeed are the victorious.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Her kim Allah'a ve Resulüne itaat eder, Allah'a saygı duyar ve O'ndan sakınırsa, işte asıl bunlar bedbahtlıktan kurtulanlardır.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اور جو حکم مانے اللہ اور اس کے رسول کا اور اللہ سے ڈرے اور پرہیزگاری کرے تو یہی لوگ کامیاب ہیں،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Dan barang siapa yang taat kepada Allah dan rasul-Nya dan takut kepada Allah dan bertakwa kepada-Nya, maka mereka adalah orang-orang yang mendapat kemenangan.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "وَمَن", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يُطِعِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱللَّهَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَرَسُولَهُۥ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَيَخْشَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱللَّهَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَيَتَّقْهِ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/ee9d2af44b2ce521d008.m4a", "gloss": null, "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": ["huwa"], "mood": "jussive"}]}, {"text": "فَأُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "هُمُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلْفَآئِزُونَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "92:5", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/6063.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "As for him who giveth and is dutiful (toward Allah)", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Bundan böyle her kim malını hayır için verir ve korunursa,", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "تو وہ جس نے دیا اور پرہیزگاری کی", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Adapun orang yang memberikan (hartanya di jalan Allah) dan bertakwa,", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "فَأَمَّا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مَنْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَعْطَىٰ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَٱتَّقَىٰ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/6dcb0e68bea8a10d7fb5.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "i bojao se (Allaha)", "en": "and was mindful (of God)", "tr": "ve sakındı", "fr": "et a craint (Dieu)", "id": "dan bertakwa", "ur": "اور پرہیزگاری کی", "bn": "এবং তাকওয়া অবলম্বন করল", "fa": "و تقوا پیشه کرد"}}]}], "forms": [{"arabic": "وَٱتَّقُوا۟", "count": 38, "first": "2:48", "audio": "audio/abf1b4ae488a3f41259a.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": 